cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its run records, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AIJADE: a long-running AI companion with evidence-gated learning and a biomimetic memory, with its experiment records"
abstract: >-
  Research code and run records for measurement studies of how wrong a long-running AI companion's own judgments are when
  checked against external evidence: learning promotion, skill self-assessment and memory retrieval. Every number the
  accompanying papers report is computed from the files under experiments/, each produced by a driver in this repository
  or marked as hand-read (experiments/README.md).
authors:
